              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਆਂਡਾ (āṇḍā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from āṇḍa, \"egg\" (CDIAL 1111). CDIAL reports Mayrhofer's view, after Kuiper, that the word is of Munda origin."
